  "colors": "UR",
  "identity": "A UR tempo deck that uses cheap instants and sorceries as a resource twice over: once to answer or bounce whatever is in the way, and once as a trigger for creatures that grow, untap or transform when a spell is cast. Delver of Secrets and Thing in the Ice convert a normal turn of interaction into an evasive or oversized body; Festival Crasher turns each spell into +2 damage the turn it is cast; Thermo-Alchemist converts every spell into a free ping and closes games the board cannot. Faithless Looting and Lightning Axe double as discard outlets that turn Fiery Temper into a one-mana three-damage spell, and the flashback halves of Faithless Looting, Silent Departure, Think Twice and Memory Deluge mean one card in hand is two spell casts across the game.",
  "restrictions": {
